## 1. Logging Strategy

### Log Levels
| Level | When to Use | Example |
|---|---|---|
| `ERROR` | Operation failed, needs attention | Payment verification failed, DB write failed |
| `WARN` | Unexpected but recoverable | Invalid webhook signature, duplicate event |
| `INFO` | Normal business events | Donation created, admin logged in, webhook processed |
| `DEBUG` | Development troubleshooting | API request/response payloads, query timing |

### What to Log

#### Payment Events (CRITICAL)
| Event | Level | Data to Capture |
|---|---|---|
| Order created | INFO | `{ order_id, amount, currency, timestamp }` |
| Payment verified | INFO | `{ donation_id, payment_id, amount, status }` |
| Payment verification failed | ERROR | `{ order_id, error_message, received_signature }` |
| Webhook received | INFO | `{ event_type, payment_id, timestamp }` |
| Webhook signature invalid | WARN | `{ ip_address, event_type, timestamp }` |
| Webhook processed | INFO | `{ payment_id, new_status, timestamp }` |
| Webhook processing failed | ERROR | `{ payment_id, error_message, stack_trace }` |

#### Admin Events
| Event | Level | Data to Capture |
|---|---|---|
| Admin login success | INFO | `{ admin_email, timestamp }` |
| Admin login failed | WARN | `{ attempted_email, ip_address, timestamp }` |
| Admin logout | INFO | `{ admin_email, timestamp }` |
| Donor log accessed | INFO | `{ admin_email, filters_applied, timestamp }` |

#### System Events
| Event | Level | Data to Capture |
|---|---|---|
| API route error | ERROR | `{ route, method, error_message, stack_trace }` |
| Database connection error | ERROR | `{ operation, table, error_message }` |
| Page render error | ERROR | `{ page, error_message, user_agent }` |

### What NOT to Log
- ❌ Razorpay `key_secret` or `webhook_secret`
- ❌ Supabase `service_role_key`
- ❌ Full card numbers or UPI PINs (never available, but guard against)
- ❌ Donor phone numbers in production logs
- ❌ Raw webhook payloads (may contain sensitive data)

