## 3. Monitoring

### Key Metrics to Track

| Metric | Source | Alert Threshold |
|---|---|---|
| Total donations (daily) | Supabase query | N/A (informational) |
| Failed payments (hourly) | Logs / Razorpay Dashboard | > 5 failures in 1 hour |
| Webhook failure rate | Logs | > 3 consecutive failures |
| API response time | Vercel Analytics | > 2 seconds average |
| Error rate (5xx) | Vercel Logs | > 1% of requests |
| Admin login failures | Logs | > 5 failures in 10 minutes |

### Monitoring Tools (By Phase)

| Phase | Tool | Cost |
|---|---|---|
| MVP / Test Mode | Vercel Logs + Razorpay Dashboard | Free |
| Post-Launch | Vercel Analytics | Free (basic) |
| Scale (Future) | Sentry (errors) + Vercel Analytics | Free tier available |

