## 4. Health Checks

### Application Health
```
GET /api/health → 200 OK

Response:
{
  "status": "healthy",
  "timestamp": "2026-06-10T00:00:00Z",
  "services": {
    "supabase": "connected",
    "razorpay": "configured"
  }
}
```

### What to Check
| Service | Check | Frequency |
|---|---|---|
| Supabase | Simple SELECT query | On health check |
| Razorpay | Key configured (not API call) | On startup |
| Next.js | Page renders without error | On health check |

