## 5. Alerting (Future Enhancement)

### Alert Channels
- Email: Admin email for critical alerts
- Slack: Webhook integration for team notifications (future)

### Alert Rules
| Condition | Severity | Action |
|---|---|---|
| Payment webhook fails 3 times | Critical | Email admin immediately |
| Database connection lost | Critical | Email admin immediately |
| 5+ failed login attempts | Warning | Log + review |
| Daily donation summary | Info | Email admin (daily digest) |

